[[Open This|Communications specialist]]

---

Builds out detailed communications for all stakeholder groups. This role is needed if scale and complexity of the engagement exceeds capacity of work for base roles, or if a deeper area of depth is needed. Ideally, a customer stakeholder is identified for this role.